                "html": "<section class=\"py-16 bg-[#F5EDE4] border-t border-b border-[#1A0F0A]/10\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"font-serif-luxury text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A0F0A]\">Ghana's Chocolate Story — Grown Here, Made Here</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base text-[#5C4A3E] leading-relaxed\">Everything Cacao was born from a passion for Ghana's cacao and a belief that the world's finest chocolate starts right here. We transform premium Ghanaian cocoa into exceptional chocolate — honouring our land, our farmers and the traditions that make Ghanaian cacao among the best in the world.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#1A0F0A]/10\">\n      <img src=\"https://everythingcacaogh.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/cocoa-farm.jpg\" alt=\"Ghanaian Cocoa Farm\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
